#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Awunayo imvume yedivayisi yaleyo klasta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Igama: enye iklasta isivele ilisebenzisa leli gama."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Iklasta ayigcinwanga: ishintshwe ngomunye umuntu kusukela kuvulwe ifomu, noma ukubhala kwehlulekile. Yivule futhi bese uphinda ushintsho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Iklasta igciniwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Isimo seklasta asishintshwanga: ukubhala kwehlulekile. Bheka ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Iklasta kanye ne-snapshot yayo egciniwe kusuliwe. Idivayisi yayo namagrafu ayo kugciniwe. Isihleli asithintwanga."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Idivayisi namagrafu ayo kudaliwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Idivayisi ayidalwanga: iklasta isivele inayo idivayisi, ishintshwe ngomunye umuntu kusukela kuvulwe ikhasi, noma i-Cacti ikwenqabile. Bheka ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Iklasta imephiwe kudivayisi."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Iklasta ayimephwanga: idivayisi ayikho, awuvunyelwe ukuyisebenzisa, isivele ithwele enye iklasta, noma iklasta ishintshwe ngomunye umuntu kusukela kuvulwe ikhasi."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Amagrafu angekho engeziwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Awekho amagrafu engeziwe: iklasta ayinayo idivayisi, noma idivayisi yayo ayisekho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Iklasta ayisuswanga ekumephweni: ishintshwe ngomunye umuntu kusukela kuvulwe ikhasi."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Iklasta isusiwe ekumephweni. Idivayisi namagrafu ayo kugciniwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Amaphathishini abekwe kuhlu kabusha kusuka ku-snapshot."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Amaphathishini awabekwanga kuhlu kabusha: idivayisi ikhutshaziwe noma ayifinyeleleki, ngakho i-Cacti iye yeqa umbuzo wayo wedatha."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Amaphathishini awabekwanga kuhlu kabusha: i-Cacti ayikwazanga ukuqhuba umbuzo wedatha. Bheka ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Amaphathishini awabekwanga kuhlu kabusha: umbuzo wedatha we-HPC Scheduler awufakiwe. Faka amathempulethi kusuka ekhasini lezempilo."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Amaphathishini awabekwanga kuhlu kabusha: iklasta ayinayo idivayisi, noma idivayisi yayo ayisekho."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Amathempulethi e-HPC Scheduler afakiwe."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Amathempulethi awafakwanga: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Ukubuka kokuqapha"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Okubonwayo akukwazanga ukufundwa. Cela umlawuli ahlole ilogi ye-plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Hlola imindeni yezizathu zokulinda kanye nobusha be-snapshot ekubukeni konke. Dlulisela iziqinisekiso, ukumepha kweklasta kanye nenqubomgomo yokulungisa kumlawuli."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Igama: sebenzisa izinhlamvu ezingu-1 kuya ku-64, amadijithi, amachashazi, amadeshi, noma ama-underscore, uqale ngohlamvu noma ngedijithi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "I-Poller: khetha enye yama-poller ahleliwe."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Isikhawu Sokuqoqa: faka amasekhondi aphelele kusuka ku-%d kuya ku-%d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Indlela Yokudlulisa: khetha enye yezindlela zokudlulisa ezisohlwini."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: faka indlela ephelele, noma uyishiye ingenalutho ukuze usebenzise okuzenzakalelayo kwe-poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "I-URL ye-slurmrestd: lo msingathi nembobo akukho ohlwini lwabasingathi be-slurmrestd ku-Izilungiselelo."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "I-URL ye-slurmrestd: faka i-URL ye-https:// engenalo igama lomsebenzisi, umbuzo, noma ucezu; i-http:// evamile yamukelwa kuphela ekhelini le-loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Umsebenzisi we-slurmrestd: sebenzisa izinhlamvu ezingeqile ku-64, amadijithi, amachashazi, amadeshi, noma ama-underscore, noma ushiye kungenalutho ngethokheni yomsebenzisi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Ifayela Lethokheni: faka indlela ephelele yefayela lethokheni ku-poller. Ithokheni uqobo lwayo ayifakwa lapha nakanye."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Ifayela Lethokheni: azikho izinkomba zamafayela ethokheni ezisethiwe okwamanje. Cela umlawuli we-Cacti azisethe ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Ifayela Lethokheni: ifayela kufanele libe ngaphakathi kwenye yezinkomba zamafayela ethokheni ezisethwe ku-Izilungiselelo (%s)."

