#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Imiyalo yeklayenti isebenzisa ama-binary asethwe ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo > HPC Scheduler kanye nokuqinisekisa kwe-Slurm komsebenzisi we-poller; indlela ye-slurm.conf yokuzikhethela ikhetha iklasta. Izinkambu ze-slurmrestd zisetshenziswa kuphela ngaleyo ndlela yokudlulisa. Ifayela lethokheni kufanele lifundwe ngumsebenzisi we-poller kuphela; i-plugin ilifunda ekuqhutshweni ngakunye futhi ayiyigcini ithokheni nakanye."

