#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Usayizi Omkhulu Wempendulo ngu-%d MiB, kodwa impendulo ehunyushiwe yalowo sayizi ayilingani ku-Collection Memory engu-%d MiB; umfundi uvumela u-%d MiB. Yenyusa i-Collection Memory noma wehlise i-Maximum Answer Size ku-Izilungiselelo."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Inikezwe ku-poller %d, umqoqi wedatha okude. Lokhu kukhishwa kuqoqa kuphela ku-poller eyinhloko, ngakho iklasta ayiqoqwa; ukuqoqwa okukude kuhlelelwe isigaba sesi-3. Yinikeze ku-poller eyinhloko."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Isikhawu sokuqoqa singaphansi komkhawulo ophansi wamasekhondi angu-%d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Isikhawu sokuqoqa samasekhondi angu-%d sifushane kunesikhawu se-poller samasekhondi angu-%d; idatha iqoqwa njalo ngamasekhondi angu-%d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "slurmrestd is reached over plain HTTP on the loopback address; the token crosses the local network stack unencrypted."
msgstr "I-slurmrestd ifinyelelwa nge-HTTP evamile ekhelini le-loopback; ithokheni idabula ku-stack yenethiwekhi yendawo ingabethelwanga."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "No reader run has finished for this cluster yet."
msgstr "Akukho ukuqhutshwa komfundi okuqedile kule klasta okwamanje."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
