#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Umhlaziyi Wedatha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Umhlaziyi wedatha we-Slurm wemiyalo ye-client. Khetha owodwa oza nokukhishwa kwe-cluster ngayinye efundwa ngemiyalo ye-client: i-v0.0.43 iku-25.05, 25.11, naku-26.05 futhi isusiwe ku-27.05; i-v0.0.44 idinga i-25.11 noma kamuva; i-v0.0.45 idinga i-26.05 noma kamuva. Ikhasi lempilo liyaxwayisa uma i-cluster ibika ukukhishwa okungenawo. Ama-cluster afundwa nge-slurmrestd ayasiziba lesi silungiselelo: asebenzisa entsha kakhulu kulezi enikezwa yi-daemon, futhi ikhasi lempilo libonisa ukuthi iyiphi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya ku-squeue ku-poller ngayinye efunda i-cluster ngemiyalo ye-client. I-plugin iyisebenzisa kuphela njengokuthi squeue --all --json kanye nomhlaziyi wedatha ongenhla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya ku-scontrol. I-plugin isebenzisa kuphela scontrol --json show node, show partition, kanye no show reservation; ayisoze yasebenzisa update, reconfigure, noma token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya ku-sshare, esetshenziswa kuphela kuma-cluster aqoqa ukwabelana ngokulinganayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Imikhawulo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Isikhathi Sokuphela Kokubiza"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ukubiza okukodwa kwesihleli okungayithatha ngaphambi kokuba kumiswe futhi isigaba sako sibhalwe njengokuhlulekile. Ukubiza akusoze kwadlula esabelweni sesikhathi somfundi naso."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Usayizi Omkhulu Wempendulo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "Ama-MiB ukubiza okukodwa kwesihleli okungawabuyisa. Impendulo enkulu iyalahlwa futhi isigaba sayo sibhalwe njengokuhlulekile. Ukucacisa ikhodi kudinga cishe izikhathi ezingu-12 zosayizi wempendulo, ngakho umfundi usebenzisa okungeqi ku-(Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB futhi ikhasi lempilo liyaxwayisa uma leli nani lilikhulu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Inkumbulo Yokuqoqa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "Ama-MiB enkumbulo ye-PHP umjikelezo ngamunye wokuqoqa okhuphula umkhawulo wawo kuwo (awusoze wehlisa owodwa). Okuzenzakalelayo okungu-1024 kulingana nezimpendulo ezifika ku-80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya ku-prlimit (util-linux), esetshenziselwa ukulinganisela indawo yekheli yomyalo ngamunye we-client. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise imiyalo ngaphandle komkhawulo wenkumbulo; ikhasi lempilo liyaxwayisa ke."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wenkumbulo Yomyalo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "Ama-MiB endawo yekheli umyalo ngamunye we-client ongayisebenzisa, nge-prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Imininingwane Yokuqinisekisa ye-slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Ama-directory Amafayela Ethokheni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Ama-directory aphelele kuma-poller angabamba amafayela ethokheni ye-slurmrestd, ehlukaniswe ngamakhoma noma izikhala. I-cluster ingabiza kuphela ifayela lethokheni elingaphakathi kwelinye lawo, eliphethwe ngumsebenzisi we-poller futhi elifinyelelwa ngaphandle kwe-symbolic link. Gcina i-directory ngayinye ibhaleka kuphela yi-root kanye nomsebenzisi we-poller. Ukungabi nalutho kusho ukuthi akukho cluster engasebenzisa i-slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Ama-host e-slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Okungakhethwa. Ama-host e-slurmrestd i-cluster engawabiza, njenge-host noma i-host:port, ehlukaniswe ngamakhoma noma izikhala. Okufakiwe okungenayo i-port kuvumela noma iyiphi i-port kuleyo host. Ukungabi nalutho kuvumela noma iyiphi i-host."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Imizuzwana ngaphambi kokuba ithokheni iphelelwe yisikhathi lapho ikhasi lempilo liqala ukuxwayisa, uma ithokheni linesikhathi sokuphelelwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Isexwayiso Sokuphelelwa Kwethokheni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina ama-cluster ayo nama-snapshot. Susa uqophi ukuze ukukhipha kuwasuse; thumela ngaphandle ama-cluster kuqala kusuka ku-HPC Clusters. I-plugin ayidali amadivayisi e-Cacti noma amasheduli e-Maint kulokhu kukhishwa, futhi isihleli asithintwa nganoma iyiphi indlela."

